  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0: Decorator support — [DecorateScoped(typeof(ISvc))]/[DecorateSingleton]/[DecorateTransient] wraps existing registrations at compile time. Inner service is self-registered for direct injection. Runtime fallback for services not registered via AutoWire. 1.3.0: AllowMultiple, DuplicateStrategy (Add/Skip/Replace), [TryScoped]/[TrySingleton]/[TryTransient], AW001+AW002 diagnostics. 1.2.0: Open generic support + AutoWireOptions(MethodName). 1.0.0: Initial release.",
